From dc1bed039700e16029e3c3c5827cf7b262bd5999 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sanyog Kale <skale@habana.ai>
Date: Wed, 19 Jan 2022 10:54:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-58071] gaudi3: add device specific files

This patch adds placeholder files for gaudi3 device which will
also facilitate compilation of arcboot rom for gaudi3. The updates
of address and offsets for gaudi3 will be added in subsequent
patches.

Change-Id: I40e16c83b6687dbeee6f57be55c31274a933a1d4
---

